{"speciesId":167,"names":{"fr":"Mimigal","es":"Spinarak","en":"Spinarak","ja":"イトマル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It spins a web using fine--but durable--thread. It then waits pa­ tiently for prey to be trapped."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"If prey becomes ensnared in its nest of spun string, it waits motionlessly until it becomes dark."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The web spun by SPINARAK can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this POKéMON can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The web spun by SPINARAK can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this POKéMON can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The web it spins can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that a SPINARAK determines its prey by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It spins a web using fine--but durable-- thread. It then waits patiently for prey to be trapped."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It spins a web using fine--but durable--thread. It then waits patiently for prey to be trapped."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il tisse une toile fine mais solide pour poser des pièges et se poste dans l’attente d’une proie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il tisse une toile fine mais solide pour poser des pièges et se poste dans l’attente d’une proie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il tisse une toile en utilisant un fil fin mais solide, puis il attend tranquillement sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Teje su telaraña con hilo fino pero resistente. Espera pacientemente a que caiga su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It spins a web using fine--but durable--thread. It then waits patiently for prey to be trapped."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"細くて 丈夫な 糸を 張り巡らして わなを 仕掛けると 獲物が かかるのを ひたすら待つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il reste immobile dans sa toile pendant des jours. Il attend que sa proie se rapproche pour la capturer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Mantiene la misma postura en su telaraña durante días, esperando a que se acerque una presa inocente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"獲物が 近くを 通りかかるまで 自分の 巣で 何日も 同じ 格好で じっと 待ち続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La toile tissée par Mimigal peut être comparée à un second système nerveux. On raconte que ce Pokémon peut déterminer quel type de proie touche sa toile grâce aux infimes vibrations des fils."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La tela que teje Spinarak puede considerarse como su segundo sistema nervioso. Dicen que puede adivinar qué tipo de presa ha caído en su red con solo observar las leves vibraciones de los hilos de la tela."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The web spun by Spinarak can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this Pokémon can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"糸で つくった ワナは 第２の 神経。 糸を 伝わる わずかな 振動 だけで 獲物の 種類が わかると いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La toile tissée par Mimigal peut être comparée à un second système nerveux. On raconte que ce Pokémon peut déterminer quel type de proie touche sa toile grâce aux infimes vibrations des fils."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La tela que teje Spinarak puede considerarse como su segundo sistema nervioso. Dicen que puede adivinar qué tipo de presa ha caído en su red con solo observar las leves vibraciones de los hilos de la tela."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The web spun by Spinarak can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this Pokémon can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"糸で つくった ワナは 第２の 神経。 糸を 伝わる わずかな 振動 だけで 獲物の 種類が わかると いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il attend dans sa toile jusqu’à ce qu’un Bombydou, son mets favori, s’y fasse prendre. C’est un Pokémon extrêmement patient."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Espera con determinación hasta que un Cutiefly cae en su telaraña, pues es su comida favorita. Es un Pokémon extremadamente paciente."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It waits intently until its preferred prey, Cutiefly, gets caught in its web. In fact, it’s quite a patient Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"好物の アブリーが 巣に かかるまで ひたすら 待ち続ける。 実に 辛抱強い ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Certains pêcheurs récoltent son fil solide pour tisser des filets et attraper des Pokémon poissons."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Algunos pescadores confeccionan redes para pescar Pokémon pez con la robusta telaraña que produce Spinarak."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Some fishermen weave its sturdy thread into nets to catch fish Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"丈夫な 糸を より合わせ さかなポケモンを 捕らえる 網を こしらえる 漁師も いるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La toile qu’il tisse avec les fils qu’il sécrète est tellement solide qu’elle peut soutenir une pierre de dix kilos."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Segrega un hilo de increíble resistencia con el que teje su tela, capaz de soportar el peso de una roca de 10 kg sin romperse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"With threads from its mouth, it fashions sturdy webs that won’t break even if you set a rock on them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"糸を はいて 作った 巣は 結構 頑丈。 １０キロの 岩を 乗せても 破れない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le poison contenu dans les mandibules de ce Pokémon n’est pas très violent, mais il suffit à immobiliser les proies piégées dans sa toile."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El veneno de sus colmillos no es demasiado tóxico, pero basta para mantener inmovilizadas a las presas que caen en sus redes."},{